{"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"I’ve spent over a decade at the intersection of clean architecture and product delivery,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"working across Turkey, and now Germany. I’ve contributed to apps with millions of active","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"users — including ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"BIP"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" (3.5M monthly actives), ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Finansbank","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" (2M+ users), and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"ioki"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":"’s white-label transit platform powering 70+ branded applications across Europe."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"My engineering philosophy is simple: code should be easy to delete, easy to test,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and hard to misuse. I care deeply about the boundaries between layers, the contracts","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"between modules, and the kind of pull request that teaches rather than just passes review.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Beyond writing Swift, I’ve led teams, introduced testing cultures from scratch, built","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"CI\/CD pipelines, and pushed for practices that make codebases healthier over time —","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"not just on the day they’re written.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This site is my development hub: a living CV, a place to think out loud about iOS"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"development, and a record of what I’ve built and learned along the way."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Currently","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Currently"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"🚀 Senior iOS Developer at "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"ioki"}]},{"type":"text","text":", Frankfurt — building the future of demand-responsive transit"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"🌱 Deepening my knowledge of Swift 6 concurrency, strict concurrency checking, and actor isolation","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"✍️ Writing about iOS architecture, testing, and the tools I reach for","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"anchor":"Lets-connect","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Let’s connect"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"💼 ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/in\/haydar-karkin\/","isActive":true,"type":"reference"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"🐙 "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/haydarKarkin","isActive":true}]}]}]}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/ReleaseNotes\/documentation\/ReleaseNotes","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"topicSections":[{"abstract":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Career history — what shipped, when, and with what impact."}],"type":"emphasis"}],"anchor":"Changelog","identifiers":["doc:\/\/ReleaseNotes\/documentation\/ReleaseNotes\/Experience"],"title":"Changelog"},{"abstract":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The tools and technologies I work with."}],"type":"emphasis"}],"anchor":"Dependencies","identifiers":["doc:\/\/ReleaseNotes\/documentation\/ReleaseNotes\/Skills"],"title":"Dependencies"},{"abstract":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Education and formal training."}],"type":"emphasis"}],"anchor":"Build-History","identifiers":["doc:\/\/ReleaseNotes\/documentation\/ReleaseNotes\/Education"],"tit